repository-code: "https://github.com/marceloroldao/resolutive-DB"
url: "https://github.com/marceloroldao/resolutive-DB/releases/tag/v1.0.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22120246"
abstract: >-
  BDR v1.0.0 is the first stable-engine line of the Resolutive Database Engine,
  providing a frozen public C++ source API, the bdr::bdr CMake consumer target,
  CompactIndex as the preferred internal index, BDR3 snapshots, BDW3 write-ahead
  logs, streaming checkpoints, crash recovery, and reproducible validation at
  high cardinality. Performance claims remain workload-specific and the project
  does not claim strict worst-case O(1) complexity for the complete engine.
keywords:
